// Title: Suspicious Microsoft Office Child Process - MacOS
// ID: 69483748-1525-4a6c-95ca-90dc8d431b68
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Sohan G (D4rkCiph3r)
// Date: 2023-01-31
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.persistence, attack.t1059.002, attack.t1137.002, attack.t1204.002
// Description: Detects suspicious child processes spawning from microsoft office suite applications such as word or excel. This could indicates malicious macro execution
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((process.parent.executable like "*_Microsoft Word*" or process.parent.executable like "*_Microsoft Excel*" or process.parent.executable like "*_Microsoft PowerPoint*" or process.parent.executable like "*_Microsoft OneNote*") and (process.executable endswith "/bash" or process.executable endswith "/curl" or process.executable endswith "/dash" or process.executable endswith "/fish" or process.executable endswith "/osacompile" or process.executable endswith "/osascript" or process.executable endswith "/sh" or process.executable endswith "/zsh" or process.executable endswith "/python" or process.executable endswith "/python3" or process.executable endswith "/wget"))
